#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:5 b27ebafa9fd5403bb45be7b0c9a38f4b
msgid "GCS Failsafe"
msgstr "地面站失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:6 b5ea6737c3634ff4a9719ee9be62e9f5
msgid ""
"Significant improvements have been made in Copter-4.0 and later for Ground "
"Control Failsafe ."
msgstr "Copter-4.0 及更高版本在地面控制站失控保护方面进行了重大改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:8 6921b75f28c7460195b2715393982dc0
msgid ""
"The Ground Station Control (GCS) failsafe controls how Copter will behave if"
" contact with the GCS is lost.  The GCS failsafe monitors the time since the"
" last MAVLink heartbeat from the GCS.  If no heartbeat is received "
":ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` seconds (Default is 5 seconds), the "
"GCS failsafe event will trigger based on your parameter settings. Note that "
"if no GCS is ever connected, the GCS failsafe will remain inactive "
"regardless of parameter settings."
msgstr ""
"地面控制站（GCS）失控保护控制 Copter 在与地面站失去联系时的行为。地面站失控保护监控自上次收到地面站 MAVLink 心跳包以来的时间。如果在"
" :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` 秒（默认为 5 "
"秒）内未收到心跳包，将根据您的参数设置触发地面站失控保护事件。请注意，如果从未连接过地面站，则无论参数设置如何，地面站失控保护都将保持非激活状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:12 376ad90a828b4f7b95087886bc6edcf8
msgid ""
"Copter also supports other failsafes: :ref:`Radio <radio-failsafe>`, "
":ref:`Battery <failsafe-battery>`, and :ref:`EKF / DCM Check <ekf-inav-"
"failsafe>`."
msgstr ""
"Copter 还支持其他失控保护：:ref:`遥控器 <radio-failsafe>`、:ref:`电池 <failsafe-battery>` 和 "
":ref:`EKF / DCM 检测 <ekf-inav-failsafe>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:15 ef1cbb73f8ef46d19d3c4dfbcddcc459
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护的触发时机"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:17 d9ebd332d373417791fffbd569e58bfe
msgid ""
"The following situations can cause a loss of GCS MAVLink heartbeat, "
"triggering a GCS failsafe event after :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` "
"seconds:"
msgstr ""
"以下情况可能导致 GCS MAVLink 心跳包丢失，在 :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` "
"秒后触发地面站失控保护事件："

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:19 2d835a9766ea43acbbbffa3eb5abeb67
msgid "The operator turns off or otherwise disconnects the GCS"
msgstr "操作员关闭或断开了地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:20 2c122fa14a524f02abb322f6b1c6b471
msgid "The copter travels beyond the range of the  GCS telemetry radios"
msgstr "飞机飞出了地面站数传电台的通信范围"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:21 6011f302fadd46308640529ce9c81b69
msgid "The GCS telemetry radio on either end loses power"
msgstr "任意一端的地面站数传电台断电"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:22 22bfdc030c7f4cea82a1f1f3255056fa
msgid ""
"Wires connecting the GCS telemetry radio to the autopilot or ground "
"equipment become disconnected"
msgstr "连接地面站数传电台与飞控或地面设备的线缆断开"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:25 c0b4842fa893464fa2924df39419ddba
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:27 0ef8126f19454c90ab5bfec9e10bacee
msgid ""
"When a GCS failsafe is triggered, the copter can be configured via "
"parameters to do nothing, land immediately, RTL, or SmartRTL.  It can also "
"be configured to bypass the failsafe in an Auto Mode mission, bypass the "
"failsafe in pilot controlled modes, or to continue landing if already in a "
"landing phase."
msgstr ""
"地面站失控保护触发时，可通过参数配置飞机执行无操作、立即降落、RTL 或 SmartRTL。还可以配置为在 Auto "
"模式任务中绕过失控保护、在飞手控制模式下绕过失控保护，或在已处于降落阶段时继续降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:29 e2e3e48651d744f9b7cf029f744e650f
msgid "If the copter is disarmed, no failsafe will take place."
msgstr "如果飞机已上锁，则不会触发任何失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:30 31495dd5670d43d8977ed96c200c34da
msgid ""
"If the copter is armed but has landed, the copter will immediately disarm."
msgstr "如果飞行器已解锁但已降落，飞行器将立即上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:31 b035e9d674914e79a83d40bfedbe919d
msgid ""
"If the copter is armed in Stabilize or Acro modes, and the throttle input is"
" at minimum, the copter will immediately disarm."
msgstr "如果飞机在 Stabilize 或 Acro 模式下已解锁，且油门输入为最低，飞机将立即上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:32 566297c3ad414a63aa78a64221694787
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the copter will take the actions as configured in the parameters "
"described below."
msgstr "否则，飞机将按照以下参数中配置的动作执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:34 5fbccb05f7c64992a6f2e224fa5bea26
msgid ""
"If the failsafe clears (i.e. GCS reconnects and MAVLink heartbeat is "
"restored) the copter will remain in its failsafe mode. It will **not** "
"automatically return to the flight mode that was active before the failsafe "
"was triggered. This means that if, for example, the vehicle was in Loiter "
"when the failsafe occurred and the flight mode was automatically changed to "
"RTL, even after the GCS reconnects, the vehicle would remain in RTL.  If the"
" pilot wished to re-take control in Loiter he/she would need to change the "
"flight mode switch to another position and then back to Loiter. This can be "
"done via the re-connected GCS also."
msgstr ""
"如果失控保护清除（即地面站重新连接且 MAVLink 心跳包恢复），飞机将保持在失控保护模式，而 **不会** "
"自动返回失控保护触发前的飞行模式。这意味着例如飞行器在 Loiter 模式下发生失控保护，飞行模式自动切换为 "
"RTL，即使地面站重新连接后，飞行器仍将保持 RTL 模式。如果飞手希望在 Loiter "
"模式下重新接管控制，需要将飞行模式开关切换到另一个位置，然后再切回 Loiter。也可以通过重新连接的地面站完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:37 747e2316cd0d46e2abd500cebec9b611
msgid "Setting the failsafe"
msgstr "设置失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:39 e0a18b69f2b14ad79957ac4d213100b6
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's  full parameter list or full parameter tree, set the "
":ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` parameter to:"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，将 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` "
"参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:41 b3020accb9c341d98ec98a8bff5a4274
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the GCS failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用 GCS 失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:42 dfdebdc63e964c0daf65633edd831344
msgid ""
"**Enabled Always RTL** (Value 1) will switch the copter to RTL Mode.  If the"
" GPS position is not usable, the copter will change to Land Mode instead."
msgstr "**启用始终 RTL** （值 1）将使飞机切换至 RTL 模式。如果 GPS 位置不可用，飞机将改为切换至 Land 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:43 080ffdfc7c3c44f58f322db553219287
msgid ""
"**Enabled Continue with Mission in Auto Mode (this value has no effect in "
"4.0 and later with FS_OPTION parameter replacing function, see below )** "
"(Value 2) will ignore the failsafe in an Auto Mode mission. Otherwise, it "
"will behave the same as *Enabled Always RTL*. This option no longer exists "
"in Copter 4.0 and later. Instead, see the :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` "
"parameter for this function. Setting this value in Copter 4.0 and later "
"version will automatically be converted and set to Value 1 (Always RTL) and "
"the :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` bitmask will be modified to include bit "
"(1) for \"Continue auto mode mission on GCS failsafe\"."
msgstr ""
"**启用在 Auto 模式任务中继续（此值在 4.0 及更高版本中不起作用，由 FS_OPTION 参数替代其功能，见下文）** （值 2）将在 "
"Auto 模式任务中忽略失控保护。否则，行为与*启用始终 RTL* 相同。此选项在 Copter 4.0 及更高版本中不再存在。请改用 "
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 参数实现此功能。在 Copter 4.0 及更高版本中设置此值将自动转换并设置为值 1（始终"
" RTL），且 :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 位掩码将被修改以包含位（1）\"在地面站失控保护时继续自动模式任务\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:44 fd23494eb0584ff4803e47277b642564
msgid ""
"**Enabled SmartRTL or RTL** (Value 3) will switch the copter to SmartRTL "
"mode. If SmartRTL is not available, the copter will switch to RTL Mode "
"instead.  If the GPS position is not usable, the copter will change to Land "
"Mode instead."
msgstr ""
"**启用 SmartRTL 或 RTL** （值 3）将使飞机切换至 SmartRTL 模式。如果 SmartRTL 不可用，飞机将改为切换至 RTL "
"模式。如果 GPS 位置不可用，飞机将改为切换至 Land 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:45 f7b5c43e4362445e83787aa6175f8e3a
msgid ""
"**Enabled SmartRTL or Land** (Value 4) will switch the copter to SmartRTL "
"mode. If SmartRTL is not available, the copter will switch to Land Mode "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"**启用 SmartRTL 或降落** （值 4）将使飞机切换至 SmartRTL 模式。如果 SmartRTL 不可用，飞机将改为切换至 Land "
"模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:46 4ce84d06f35c47bd83beaffb2d429395
msgid "**Enabled Always Land** (Value 5) will switch the copter to Land Mode."
msgstr "**启用始终降落** （值 5）将使飞机切换至 Land 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:47 38a9f614d22d4f9c9faf91c8f049453f
msgid ""
"**Auto DO_LAND_START or RTL** (Value 6) will execute a DO_LAND_START auto "
"mission sequence or and RTL if no DO_LAND_START sequence exists(see "
":ref:`common-do-land-start`)."
msgstr ""
"**Auto DO_LAND_START 或 RTL** （值 6）将执行 DO_LAND_START 自动任务序列，如果不存在 "
"DO_LAND_START 序列则执行 RTL（参见 :ref:`common-do-land-start`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:48 8c9a4daeed8e4e0dae8867e099354f48
msgid ""
"**BRAKE or LAND** (Value 7): switch to BRAKE mode if included in firmware or"
" to LAND mode, if not included."
msgstr "**BRAKE 或 LAND** （值 7）：如果固件包含 BRAKE 模式则切换至 BRAKE，否则切换至 LAND 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:49 471f53ca7aef470a9694c571bff01fab
msgid ""
"Any invalid value (Such as accidentally enter 99 as a parameter value) will "
"will behave the same as **Enabled Always RTL**"
msgstr "任何无效值（例如意外输入 99 作为参数值）将与 **启用始终 RTL** 行为相同"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:51 1640dc87b28847dca38adcd210c37bca
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` parameter (Copter 4.0 and later) is a "
"bitmask parameter to select one or more options that modify the standard "
"actions of the radio, GCS, and battery failsafe. In the Mission Planner full"
" parameter list or full parameter tree, the handy checkbox popup window is "
"an easy what to set this (and any other bitmask) parameter. Be sure to go to"
" Help > Check Beta Updates to pull the latest parameter definitions first "
"while connected to the internet. The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` bits are "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 参数（Copter 4.0 "
"及更高版本）是一个位掩码参数，用于选择一个或多个修改遥控器、地面站和电池失控保护标准动作的选项。在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，方便的复选框弹出窗口是设置此参数（及任何其他位掩码参数）的简便方法。在联网状态下，请先前往 Help > Check "
"Beta Updates 拉取最新参数定义。:ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 的各位含义如下："

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:53 bd14cfa2d26d460a95d2023706d8b996
msgid ""
"bit 0 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-"
"failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 0 位置位：在 Auto 模式下继续执行 :ref:`遥控器失控保护 <radio-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:54 7d14898c135248fe9df45947e84c92ec
msgid ""
"bit 1 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 1 位置位：在 Auto 模式下继续执行 :ref:`地面站失控保护<gcs-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:55 369c385b3e7445778fd2df9215278ab0
msgid ""
"bit 2 set: Continue if in guided mode :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 2 位置位：在 Guided 模式下继续执行 :ref:`遥控器失控保护 <radio-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:56 0735141c69854d6183cc163d77ff0791
msgid "bit 3 set: Continue if landing on any failsafe"
msgstr "第 3 位置位：任何失控保护时，如果正在降落则继续"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:57 235f1b5357884250b1aaaad43c30c689
msgid ""
"bit 4 set: Continue in pilot control on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 4 位置位：在 :ref:`地面站失控保护<gcs-failsafe>` 时保持飞手控制"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:58 e7029de840dc44d69c3adbf0f3023bde
msgid "bit 5 set: Release gripper during failsafe handling"
msgstr "置位 bit 5：在失控保护处理期间释放抓取器"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:59 a6cda079111f4d989c5c97f3bdf24425
msgid ""
"If none of the above are set, then execute the :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE "
"<FS_GCS_ENABLE>` option as configured."
msgstr "如果以上均未置位，则按配置执行 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:61 106ab92d917a495eb2dee5ee6e5f2fc8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Only bitmask bits 1, 3, 4 & 5 affect actions taken during GCS failsafe. This"
" parameter also works in conjunction with the battery and radio failsafe, so"
" ensure you are taking all options into account when setting this parameter."
msgstr ""
"只有位掩码第 1、3、4 位会影响地面站失控保护期间采取的动作。此参数还与电池和遥控器失控保护协同工作，因此在设置此参数时请确保考虑所有选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:68 e8a354679e884b438200aa38aa7be4f9
msgid ""
"All Failsafe Parameters can be observed or set from the Advanced Parameter "
"List in Mission Planner."
msgstr "所有失控保护参数均可在 Mission Planner 的高级参数列表中查看或设置。"
